    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave D dedicated benchmark gates for distributed tensor hot paths. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Gates DT-BM-01..04 lock the acceptable performance envelope for the distributed tensor module Wave D operability deliverables.</para>
<para>Wave D Distributed Tensor Benchmark Gates ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── DT-BM-01 Sharded op dispatch latency ≤ 1 µs (per-call) DT-BM-02 Tensor sync round-trip ≤ 10 µs (per-cycle) DT-BM-03 Partition routing decision latency ≤ 1 µs (per-call) DT-BM-04 Concurrent sharded ops (8 workers) ≥ 500 ops/sec total</para>
<sect1 id="bench__distributed__tensor__dedicated__gates_8cpp_1autotoc_md23_1s1"><sect2 id="bench__distributed__tensor__dedicated__gates_8cpp_1autotoc_md23">
